# Google Calendar Appointment Schedule embed URL
#
# Setup (one-time, in Google Calendar):
# 1. Open https://calendar.google.com → Create → Appointment schedule
# 2. Title: "Free Trial Spanish Class (25 min)"
# 3. Duration: 25 minutes | Location: Google Meet
# 4. Set weekly availability for your timezone
# 5. Scheduling window → Minimum time before appointment: 24 hours
# 6. Share → Website embed → Inline booking page → Copy the iframe src URL
#
# Then copy this file to .env.local and paste your embed URL.
# Your share link (calendar.app.google/...) redirects to the embed URL below.
# Use the iframe src from Google Calendar → Share → Website embed → Inline booking page,
# or append ?gv=true to the redirected calendar.google.com/.../schedules/... URL.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_BOOKING_URL=https://calendar.google.com/calendar/appointments/schedules/YOUR_SCHEDULE_ID?gv=true
